OL,3,GNEWSA'City's masked e-bike riders      
OL,4,Aintimidate us'                         
OL,6,FA petition to ban e-bikers and cyclists
OL,7,Ffrom wearing face coverings in Coventry
OL,8,Fcity centre is drawing support as      
OL,9,Fpeople say they feel frightened and    
OL,10,Fthreatened.                            
OL,12,FThe petition, which targets coverings  
OL,13,Fsuch as balaclavas on riders, has been 
OL,14,Fsubmitted to the city council by Reform
OL,15,Fcouncillor Jackie Gardiner after       
OL,16,Fattracting 249 signatures.             
OL,18,FIf approved, the ban would be added to 
OL,19,Fthe terms of a new Public Spaces       
OL,20,FProtection Order (PSPO) covering the   
OL,21,Farea within the ring road, which came  
OL,22,Finto force on Saturday.                
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
