OL,3,GNEWSA'City's masked e-bike riders      
OL,4,Aintimidate us'                         
OL,6,FJohn McNicholas, council cabinet member
OL,7,Ffor community safety, said the petition
OL,8,Fwould be considered under community    
OL,9,Fconsultation running to 10 December.   
